        "TileImage": "$($repository 93144bc8-e10d-4340-8530-3b70e67d0dee).Image",
        "Description": "47 Has recieved intel on a number of important guests staying at Mendoza. A guard, Onzo Malavia, has been spotted talking with providence members. It will be useful to make the most of his guise. Tommy Hamilton is a member of the Ark society, and is a well known multi-billionare and black market drugs dealer. The two waiters know Onzo well and have both been commited for poisoning. Barely a week ago they were returned to service after being freed by Onzo.",
